  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7414901",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741490101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741490101": {
            "id": "741490101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Any new work?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490102"
            ]
          },
          "741490102": {
            "id": "741490102",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Oh? I suppose our commissions here at Tales of Humanity are too easy for you... Or have you been in dire need of Mora lately?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490104",
              "741490106"
            ]
          },
          "741490104": {
            "id": "741490104",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Mm-hmm. A most common sentiment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490107"
            ]
          },
          "741490107": {
            "id": "741490107",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "If there's one thing we don't lack here, it's work to be done. In fact, The Steambird could probably be considered the largest clearinghouse for jobs outside of the Adventurers' Guild.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490108"
            ]
          },
          "741490108": {
            "id": "741490108",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Well, I say that, but we didn't really need to take up the social services aspect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490109"
            ]
          },
          "741490109": {
            "id": "741490109",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Whatever the case, since you need Mora, allow me to recommend a certain long-term gig to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490110"
            ]
          },
          "741490110": {
            "id": "741490110",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "This is a note that Mr. Leroy left with us over half a year ago — most of us who live on this street know him well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490111"
            ]
          },
          "741490111": {
            "id": "741490111",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Although his reputation when he was younger was less than stellar, I haven't heard any untoward rumors concerning him in recent years.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490112"
            ]
          },
          "741490112": {
            "id": "741490112",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "He's been alone most of his life, and with his only daughter not being by his side, there's no one to take care of him... I suppose that's where a person could use an hourly worker to help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490113"
            ]
          },
          "741490113": {
            "id": "741490113",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "From what I know, he's not hard up for Mora, so you'll be well-paid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490114"
            ]
          },
          "741490114": {
            "id": "741490114",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "It's a nearly danger-free job with great compensation to boot. No reason not to consider it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490115"
            ]
          },
          "741490115": {
            "id": "741490115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So we just need to help him with some housework, right? Paimon thinks that sounds pretty chill!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490116"
            ]
          },
          "741490116": {
            "id": "741490116",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Please give me his address, if you would.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490117"
            ]
          },
          "741490117": {
            "id": "741490117",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Of course. Just turn two corners, and loop around... Actually, never mind. Let me give you a map instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490118"
            ]
          },
          "741490118": {
            "id": "741490118",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "Remember to tell him that I was the one to introduce you, alright?"
          },
          "741490106": {
            "id": "741490106",
            "speakerId": 5042,
            "speakerName": "Euphrasie",
            "text": "A diligent youngster, I see. Well, sure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7414902",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Mr. Leroy",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741490201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741490201": {
            "id": "741490201",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Athos's shirt, 1,000 Mora... Morticia's necklace... Tsk, tsk. Youngsters these days sure know how to spend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490202"
            ]
          },
          "741490202": {
            "id": "741490202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hello there, Mr. Leroy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490203"
            ]
          },
          "741490203": {
            "id": "741490203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey there! Euphrasie sent us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490204"
            ]
          },
          "741490204": {
            "id": "741490204",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You explain to Mr. Leroy why you're here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490205"
            ]
          },
          "741490205": {
            "id": "741490205",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Haha, that was half a year ago, wasn't it? I didn't think Euphrasie would hold on to that commission for so long.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490206"
            ]
          },
          "741490206": {
            "id": "741490206",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "It's true — I did think of hiring hourly workers. After all, even the most capable of us get old and need others to take care of them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490207"
            ]
          },
          "741490207": {
            "id": "741490207",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "I spent so much of my life working to have this home, but in my old age, I found that I had no one to share it with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490208"
            ]
          },
          "741490208": {
            "id": "741490208",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "That did make me quite sad for a time — so it's a good thing, all in all, that my daughter and son-in-law have come to take care of me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490209"
            ]
          },
          "741490209": {
            "id": "741490209",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "They're good children, they love each other very much, and they keep me company. There's nothing more that I could want.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490210"
            ]
          },
          "741490210": {
            "id": "741490210",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "That's to say, youngster, that I'm not hiring anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490213"
            ]
          },
          "741490213": {
            "id": "741490213",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Well, now, don't be too down. That's not how young'uns should be. You lot should be enjoying your best life, armed with a smile!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490214"
            ]
          },
          "741490214": {
            "id": "741490214",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Also, since you made the trip here, and since Euphrasie recommended you, I do, in fact, have some work for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490215"
            ]
          },
          "741490215": {
            "id": "741490215",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "It just so happens that the kids are out, and I can't quite handle everything here. Of course, you will be paid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490216"
            ]
          },
          "741490216": {
            "id": "741490216",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, nice! You're a great guy, Mr. Leroy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490217"
            ]
          },
          "741490217": {
            "id": "741490217",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Hahaha, and you've got quite the silver tongue!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490218"
            ]
          },
          "741490218": {
            "id": "741490218",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Alright, then, go help me clean the stains by the door and behind the house — and feed Nana some fish while you're at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490219"
            ]
          },
          "741490219": {
            "id": "741490219",
            "speakerId": 21249,
            "speakerName": "Benoit Leroy",
            "text": "Right, I forgot to mention, but Nana's my cat — you know, the one by the door. Thanks in advance on Nana's behalf.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741490220"
            ]
          },
          "741490220": {
            "id": "741490220",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, that sounds simple enough. No problem! Leave it to us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
